{"title":"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec07dc31d7fbfbd2889e390710f2cb34ceddbc3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20 + 25}{25 + 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"64\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/5/07521da7946d36ed1acabc0542cdd71a58c9c4e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 2025 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"487\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/9/6a91d5062eb09afdc4c0cc1ba4dc7023e3fb32d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20 + 25}{25 + 20} = \\frac{45}{45} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"190\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Commutative_property\" title=\"Commutative property\">commutative property</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Addition\" title=\"Addition\">addition</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/6/8460cf123e72c363f0764d4c6d14ba5c3d28a59b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20 + 25}{25 + 20} = \\frac{25 + 20}{25 + 20} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"231\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley\">2025 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_